DirectoryIndex disabled
DirectorySlash Off
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} !=on
RewriteRule ^ https://erp.edudesk-inter.com%{REQUEST_URI} [R=301,L]
RewriteRule ^ http://[::1]:3000%{REQUEST_URI} [P,L]
Header always edit Location "http://localhost:3000" "https://erp.edudesk-inter.com"
Header always edit Location "http://127.0.0.1:3000" "https://erp.edudesk-inter.com"
Header always edit Location "http://erp.edudesk-inter.com" "https://erp.edudesk-inter.com"
